  "description": "Assistant Manager Lee Jae-Yoon, who had a one-sided crush on Deputy Manager Choi Ji-Hak from the HR team—the only person who treated him kindly when he struggled to adapt to the company. After submitting his resignation, he visits an autumn foliage festival alone, only to unexpectedly run into Choi and his family. Unable to hide his feelings for the married deputy manager, Jae-Yoon impulsively confesses and, in a moment of panic, steals his wedding ring before running away—leading to a disastrous day at the festival. \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Note: Part of the 2024 Post Type Fall Anthology (\\[BL\\] 2024 포스타입 앤솔로지 | 가을).*",
